>> title: Crisped Marinated Tofu, Air Fryer
>> category: Fried & Crispy
>> tags: tofu, air fryer, basket, vegan, soy, bowl
>> counters: The Air Fryer & the Pot
>> dish: crisped-marinated-tofu
>> kit: Air Fryer
>> aka: air fryer tofu, crispy air fryer tofu, basket tofu, marinated tofu in the air fryer
>> servings: 4
>> time: 40 min
>> slack: forgiving — a cube that is not crisp yet goes back for three minutes, and tofu that sat five minutes too long is still dinner
>> washing-up: the basket, the bowl

>> step: Written for a preheated 5.7 L basket. From cold, add three minutes. A 3.5 L basket is two batches, not more minutes.
One bowl does the marinade and the cornflour. A second one makes three things.

>> step: pat hard, cube, and stand 10 min in the bowl
Pat @extra-firm tofu{14%oz}(400 g) dry, cut in 3/4-in cubes and ~stand{10%min} in a #bowl{} with @soy sauce{2%Tbs}, @toasted sesame oil{2%tsp}, @rice vinegar{1%Tbs}, @maple syrup{2%tsp}.

>> step: dust with cornflour in the same bowl
Dust @&(~1)marinated tofu{} with @cornflour{1%Tbs}(cornstarch) and turn it over until every face is dry to the touch.

>> step: roast in the basket 200°C (400°F), 15–18 min, one layer
Roast @&(~1)dusted tofu{} in a preheated #air fryer basket{} at 200°C (400°F) for ~air fry{17%min}, one layer.

>> step: toss the basket at halfway — corners deep gold and no longer soft
Toss @&(~1)tofu{} by shaking the basket once.

>> step: toss hot in the same bowl
Toss @&(~1)crisped tofu{} with @sesame seeds{1%Tbs}, @scallions{2}(sliced thin).

>> step: The plain file presses 30 min under a weight; blotted hard, the basket's draught does that drying as it cooks.
No press. A skillet cannot make that trade and a basket can.
